::: flashcard{deck="12-Pure Lambda Calculus"}
Which evaluation strategies are strict/lazy?
=== key
- Strict evaluation strategy:
  - Call by value.
- Lazy evaluation strategy:
  - Call by name.
  - Call by need.
  - Normal order.
:::
